{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09881","headline":"故河南尹岐国公赠工部尚书苏公挽歌二首 二 · 岑参","name":"故河南尹岐国公赠工部尚书苏公挽歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日扃泉户，青春掩夜台。\n旧堂阶草长，空院砌花开。\n山晚铭旌去，郊寒骑吹回。\n三川难可见，应惜庾公才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}